 "summary": "IINA is a free, open-source video player for macOS built on mpv, with a modern Mac interface. It is strong for watching: subtitles (including online search), Picture in Picture, music mode, playlists, seek thumbnails and plugins.",
 "where_it_wins": [
  "Full playback features: chapters, frame step, A-B loop, PiP, music mode",
  "Online subtitle search and smart local subtitle matching",
  "Plugins, mpv config and scripts, browser extensions",
  "Supports macOS 12 and Intel Macs",
  "Seek-bar thumbnails, playback history and resume"
 ],
 "where_schnellbild_wins": [
  "Folder browser with a thumbnail grid of photos and videos together",
  "Shows images (HEIC, RAW, PSD, SVG, PDF …); IINA plays no still images",
  "Slideshow through subfolders mixing photos and videos",
  "ZIP/RAR/7z and comics open as folders, also with passwords",
  "Two-pane file sorting with copy, move, rename, trash and undo",
  "App Sandbox and no network access"
 ],
